# Wave W17-AB (Route 224): head post — a headstone marker post on the stone coast: a weathered post carrying a small rounded WHITE HEADSTONE at its head, tended and honest — the design’s white stones standing in the prop register (design: a white headstone stands at the far end of the Foamline Path, and flowers beyond counting; the stones on this coast are kept, not carved fresh). On head turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from the fleet’s marker posts by the stone entire: posts mark a road, this one carries a grave’s white tablet.
